flowchart TD
    A[Wallet and Rabbit client] --> B[Canonical work context]
    B --> C[RandomX proof search]
    C --> D[Work V1 ticket]
    D --> E{Proof and eligibility valid?}
    E -- No --> F[Reject ticket]
    E -- Yes --> G{Seat already exists for wallet and epoch?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Keep one canonical seat]
    G -- No --> I[Create canonical WorkSeat]
    H --> J[Deterministic LCQ queue]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Scheduled producer builds and signs block]
    K --> L[All nodes independently verify]
